<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_III__cl_15__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who has in his possession or control any device referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or any password, access credentials, electronic signature or computer data referred to in paragraph (1)(b) with the intention that the device, password, access credentials, electronic signature or computer data be used by himself or by any other person for the purpose of committing any offence under this Act commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding three hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
