<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_II__cl_6__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Committee shall convene its meeting as often as the Chairman may determine and the meeting shall be held at the time and place as determined by the Chairman."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
