<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_II__cl_6__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chairman shall preside at all meetings of the Committee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
