<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_II__cl_6__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Chairman is absent from any meeting of the Committee, he may direct the Deputy Chairman to replace him as the chairman of the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
