<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall, in relation to any person, whatever his nationality or citizenship, have effect outside as well as within Malaysia, and where an offence under this Act is committed by any person in any place outside Malaysia, he may be dealt with in respect of such offence as if the offence was committed at any place within Malaysia."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_I__cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
