<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of subsection (1), this Act shall apply if for the offence in question, the computer system, program or computer data was in Malaysia or connected to or sent to or used by or with a computer system, program or computer data in Malaysia at the material time or the person affected by the commission of the offence is a Malaysian citizen. Interpretation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
