<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__list_1__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "any other information on the site of the installation of communication equipment, available on the basis of the service agreement or arrangement; “Minister” means the Minister charged with the responsibility for matters relating to cybercrimes; “authorized officer” means any police officer, or any other public officer or officer of the Commission authorized in writing by the Minister under section 26; “officer of the Commission” means an officer of the Malaysian Communications and Multimedia Commission; “service provider” means a person, whether licensed under the Communications and Multimedia Act 1998 [Act 588] or not, who—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
