<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_I__cl_3__list_2__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "provides an information and communication service, including telecommunications; “program” means a set of instructions or statements that when executed in a computer system causes the computer system to perform a function; “computer system” means any device or a group of interconnected or related devices, one or more of which, pursuant to a program, gathers, stores and performs automatic processing of computer data, including a computer; “Commission” means the Malaysian Communications and Multimedia Commission established under section 4 of the Malaysian Communications and Multimedia Commission Act 1998 [Act 589]."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
