<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Chief Executive shall establish, administer, maintain and manage an integrated information system containing such information received or gathered by the Chief Executive which may be used to prevent and investigate cybercrimes."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
