<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of subsection (1), the Chief Executive may, by written notice, request any person or Government Entity to provide any information relating to cybercrimes in such manner as may be determined by the Chief Executive."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
