<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person or Government Entity to whom the written notice is given under subsection (2) may, to the extent permitted under any applicable written laws, provide to the Chief Executive the information as requested."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
