<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_50__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person or Government Entity may, on its own initiative, provide to the Chief Executive any information relating to cybercrimes in such manner as may be determined by the Chief Executive and the Chief Executive may receive and retain such information."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
