<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A service provider shall take necessary measures to prevent any services provided by the service provider from being used for the commission of cybercrimes."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
