<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_51__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An authorized officer may, in consultation with the Commission, by written notice, require a service provider to take such measures to prevent the commission or attempted commission of any cybercrime, or to assist the enforcement in relation to such offence, in such manner as may be specified in the written notice."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
