<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_55__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where a person has given his consent for a notice or document to be served on him through electronic means, the notice or document shall be deemed to have been served at the time when the electronic notice or document is transmitted to his account through the electronic means. Attempt and abetment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
