<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "56" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
