<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_56> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who attempts to commit or abets the commission of any offence under this Act shall, on conviction, be liable to the punishment provided for such offence. Protection against suit and legal proceedings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "57" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_57> <https://schema.org/text> "No action, suit, prosecution or other proceedings shall be brought, instituted or maintained in any court against the Minister, any member of the Committee, the Chief Executive or any authorized officer on account of or in respect of any act, neglect or default done or omitted by him in the course of carrying out his duties under this Act unless it can be proven that the act, neglect or default was done or omitted in bad faith and without reasonable cause. Prosecution"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "58" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
