<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_58> <https://schema.org/text> "No prosecution for an offence under this Act shall be instituted except by or with the written consent of the Public Prosecutor. Liability of director, etc., of company, etc."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
