<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_59__para_b__subpara_i> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
