<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "31" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
