<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The list prepared in accordance with subsection (1) shall be delivered immediately to—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "the occupant of the premises where any computer system or part of the computer system, computer data, computer data storage medium, book, account, document, signboard, card, letter, pamphlet, leaflet, notice, facility, apparatus, vehicle, equipment, device, thing or matter seized is found; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_31__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
