<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Public Prosecutor may authorize an authorized officer to enter any premises and to install on such premises, any device for the interception, retention, collection or recording of the communication or content data and to remove and retain such device."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
