<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Where any person is charged with an offence under this Act, any information obtained by an authorized officer under this section, whether before or after the person is charged, shall be admissible in evidence at his trial."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
