<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The service provider shall keep confidential the execution of any power provided for under this section and any matter relating to it."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
