<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The authorized officer examining a person under subsection (1) shall first inform that person of the provision of subsections (2) and (3)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
