<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "When any person is charged with any offence in relation to the making or the contents of any statement made by him to an authorized officer in the course of an investigation made under this Act, that statement may be used as evidence in the prosecution’s case. Additional powers"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
