<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VI__cl_24__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who transmits, distributes, publishes, sells or offers for sale or otherwise makes available by means of a computer system any intimate images of any person, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to a fine not exceeding three hundred thousand ringgit or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VI__cl_24__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VI__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
