<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_VI__cl_24__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who commits an offence under subsection (1) with the intention to cause humiliation or harm to, or to coerce or intimidate, the person depicted in the intimate image, shall, on conviction, be liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding seven years or to a fine not exceeding five hundred thousand ringgit or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
