<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_20__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "knowing or having reason to believe that the credential will be used, or is likely to be used, for the purpose of committing, or facilitating the commission of, any offence under any written law, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both, and for a second or subsequent offence, to a fine not exceeding three hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
