<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@/~part_V__cl_20__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "It shall not be an offence under subsection (1) for a person to transmit or otherwise make available credentials of any user by reason only that the person, in the ordinary course of providing such facilities or services, provides or operates facilities for network access, or provides services relating to, or connections for, the transmission, routing or storage of data."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/8/eng@> .
